{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5695857f6d97aefaf3d53e3b46846a6b5052b85c2ab563536c94d2e06ac8603c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f2eec1a881d9d868252ac8f59936d9922a46fcd14685bfe5df4509a9b77ca52",
      "text": "辛苦了。今天的拍摄结束了，\n想跟你汇报一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21b2ba1811e66eef3e01a48e589b379c48c9efa25b3a8354c7e883e04351ba73",
      "text": "辛苦了，谢谢您",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bb268090d6b42c0b6d51289075004b581841125dc306005d93c3dd6e2af5d3a",
      "text": "……呐，●●●●プロデューサー。\n教官这个角色真难演啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f854ac8f440e7b3ba0ad92cb583edb93bdbe3d0227611b41984276055dc66a",
      "text": "身处教育引导别人的立场，\n我再次深刻体会到有多不容易了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56ab57693994c6870dcee983b7b6d7084591d3c15be3d4733f9a46a52253b851",
      "text": "我现在光顾好自己\n就有些竭尽全力了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b678f3ab3f89b1fffbad2a64231fac789a226492c2cc86fb7b60b57286ade46",
      "text": "看到硲先生完美诠释了校长一角，\n我更是深有体会。不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5a616ac79fffd35bfc33ebe3d055fa68132ca2b63e6cbfe2e3ddb9b97b0f75f",
      "text": "不仅是皮埃尔他们，连工作人员和\n导演也夸奖了我，让我有了信心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b8ef70be61d2b76461ad249b03bd809c2937e11c25251f1b4bf4cb77d096899",
      "text": "感觉自己哪怕只有一点点，\n也是在成长着的啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bca60228633d911984031fbd9bc4c64fed5d20f9378804840f5cc94bb61041d",
      "text": "请加油\n我会一直支持您的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf8cddc7d3f00517730ab32d56c0b52ca393a6ed3d3f11c8bad285f4e05d4910",
      "text": "恭二先生的话\n一定没问题的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a951373f1567d80f35fac8014bf10e77603b27a7f86e841d83d8ee8dc06b15f0",
      "text": "……谢了，下次我也努力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:009kyj_402_2_4_009_02_09_b:2_4_009_02_09_b:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:902b971fdcaf8b8567dee03c722b6fe826b5590ee49e3a006e1705d19f420740",
      "text": "为了能让大家觉得把这个角色交给我演是正确的，\n我会全力以赴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
